<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In MMPersuade: A Dataset and Evaluation Framework for Multimodal Persuasion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Large Language Models Usage Statement</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
