<span id="A3.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:1pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A3.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">meta-llama/Llama-4-Maverick-17B-128E-Instruct-FP8</span></span></span>
